{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-56","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815432-line","text":"一个背着垃圾桶的人遇到了你。他蹲了下来，向你展示它的宝贝垃圾桶。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815433-line","text":"「这是一个神奇的空间。」他摆了摆手，把那些酸酸情诗掏出来扔掉，为你腾出空间。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-talk-403815434-line","text":"他小声对你说，「将你的废物投入，它们会进化出一些进步意识…然后自己精神焕发地跑出来！」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-722388138374174098-choice","text":"你想起了这些废弃物品的前世今生。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-17114457710524011732-effect","text":"舍弃1个随机奇物，获得2个奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-16376933470002432117-choice","text":"趁他不注意，快速窃取！","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-8323497576813601097-effect","text":"舍弃1个随机奇物，获得3个随机奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-56-text-13483051442745723944-effect","text":"舍弃1个奇物，获得2个随机奇物。","speaker":""}]}
